# walk-away.persona — the walk-away/resume acceptance scenario: a flight is in
# the air and a case is unanswered when the session restarts; the fresh session
# reports the flight from durable evidence in the unchecked form, and the case,
# which only the conversation held, is gone: a yes after the restart drafts
# nothing. Turn map: 1 ask, 2 zone ask (case left unanswered), 3 restart,
# 4 yes, 5 end.
expertise=novice
answer.1=rename the helper in the export module for clarity
answer.2=tighten the permission checks on the admin endpoints
answer.3=@event:session-restart
answer.4=yes
answer.5=that's all
